\details{
\strong{When the EM algorithm stops.} Two criteria, both required at the
same iteration (or the iteration limit):
\deqn{\max_l \frac{|\psi_l^{(i)} - \psi_l^{(i-1)}|}{\max(|\psi_l^{(i-1)}|,
